#title  That Day (opening narration)
#song   0x0D
#tempo  66
#reverb 50
; C minor. A: a lone piano over a low drone and choir (i-VI-iv-V / i-VII-VI-V).
; B: the cellos quietly sing the main theme (title.mml) in C minor over piano
; arpeggios. 16 bars, loops.

#define NCM o3 l8 c g > c e- g e- c < g
#define NAB o2 l8 a- > e- a- > c e- c < a- e-
#define NEB o2 l8 e- b- > e- g b- g e- < b-
